TYPES.md §9.3: `entry t.k` of a keyed list whose key field is an enum: k must be a member.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local enum Kind { a, b }

local record Row {
  kind: Kind
  label: String
}

local let rows: [Row] keyed by kind = []

entry rows.a { label: "x" }
entry rows.nosuch { label: "y" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E3003]  a/a.canon:13:12
  a.Kind has no member nosuch

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
